{
  "name": "TradingView Chart (With Indicators)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeCommand",
        "command": "=tradingview-screenshot {{ $json.ticker }} -i {{ $json.interval || '1D' }} -s {{ $json.studies || 'MACD,RSI' }}",
        "cwd": "/home/pi/tradingview-screenshot/charts"
      },
      "id": "ssh-execute-chart-indicators",
      "name": "Generate Chart with Indicators",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.ssh",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [450, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "sshPassword": {
          "id": "YOUR_SSH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "TradingView Container SSH"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "path": "=/home/pi/tradingview-screenshot/charts/tradingview_{{ $json.interval || '1D' }}_chart_{{ $json.ticker.replace(':', '_') }}_indicators.png"
      },
      "id": "ssh-download-chart-indicators",
      "name": "Download Chart",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.ssh",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [650, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "sshPassword": {
          "id": "YOUR_SSH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "TradingView Container SSH"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Generate Chart with Indicators": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Chart",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "saveExecutionProgress": true,
    "saveManualExecutions": true
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "tags": [],
  "triggerCount": 0,
  "notes": "## TradingView Chart Generator (With Indicators)\n\n### Input JSON:\n```json\n{\n  \"ticker\": \"NASDAQ:AAPL\",\n  \"interval\": \"4h\",\n  \"studies\": \"MACD,RSI\"\n}\n```\n\n### SSH Credentials:\n- Host: <raspi-ip>\n- Port: 2222\n- Username: root\n- Password: (set via ROOT_PASSWORD env var)\n\n### Intervals (case-insensitive):\n- 15m, 1h, 4h, 1D, 1W\n\n### Available Studies:\n- MACD, RSI, DMI, BB, VWAP, EMA, SMA, ATR, ADX, STOCH, CCI, MFI, OBV, ICHIMOKU\n- Any TradingView study name"
}
